WEBVTT

00:00:59.876 --> 00:01:02.116
but this scares even me.

00:01:02.156 --> 00:01:04.756
But this is not a scary talk,
I promise you.

00:01:05.676 --> 00:01:08.636
(Laughter)

00:01:08.676 --> 00:01:11.196
I think I know
what you're probably thinking,

00:01:11.236 --> 00:01:15.596
which is, "We are already experiencing

00:01:15.636 --> 00:01:19.156
severe impacts from climate change.

00:01:19.156 --> 00:01:23.916
How can the world house
another three billion people?

00:01:24.276 --> 00:01:28.396
And how can their housing needs
be part of the solution,

00:01:28.396 --> 00:01:30.196
rather than part of the problem?"